WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,670
Young Master

2
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:03,440
I want to meet Miss Heiji. The admission fee is 10 taels.

3
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:07,420
so many people

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,580
Miss Heiji is Wenxiang Ge Huakui

5
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,620
Are there any soldiers entering the tomb?

6
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:11,540
There are naturally many people

7
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:15,820
A bit interesting Wang Yang Muying

8
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:18,420
Unexpectedly, the former serious son of the living palace

9
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,380
Come to Xiaoji too

10
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,340
What season?

11
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,980
Why am I here to find you?

12
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,540
Your eldest brother, I am romantic by nature

13
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,060
Isn't it common to come here?

14
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:26,180
Xiaoxing won once

15
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:27,740
You really think you are talented

16
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:28,740
Whether it is

17
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:29,820
at least you lost

18
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:32,500
Mr. Fang, who are you?

19
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,740
Hundred Garden Masters Association

20
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:35,060
I even called you and asked you something

21
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:36,940
It turned out to be Brother Chu. What a coincidence

22
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:38,420
How can you hang out with this kind of fangu boy?

23
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,900
I’m not afraid of being sold to Wang Yang by him one day

24
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:42,860
Brother Mu is not a bad person. Before, I was only unfamiliar with you because of Brother Chu’s face.

25
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:43,940
Don’t argue with him today

26
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,260
Don't let your mood get bad.

27
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,460
Miss Heiji is not Ji

28
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:47,980
Who here is not here for his talent?

29
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:50,260
The son of Duke Cheng is indeed worthy of his reputation and is extremely rough.

30
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:51,380
I also took a dinner plate and put it on the book

31
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,380
I’m afraid I can’t even write my own name Wang Yang

32
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:55,980
Don't embarrass yourself here, Caixue

33
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,100
That doesn't change the picture

34
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:58,140
My son

35
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:00,220
I came here just for Miss Heiji’s body.
